ith Cholestyramine's bile acid binding mechanism).\n\n▶ Selected: Interpretation A\n<|tool_call>verify_claim<|\"|>Cholestyramine reduces Raloxifene bioavailability by approximately 60% through GI binding and enterohepatic recycling interruption<|\"|>",
