sis prevention regardless of anticoagulant therapy in the early post-stent period).\n\n▶ Selected: Interpretation A\n<|tool_call>verify_claim<|\"|>Triple antithrombotic therapy with Aspirin 325mg significantly increases major bleeding compared to reduced-dose Aspirin 81mg regimens<|\"|>",
