 reduction, not CYP metabolism — the absorption effect is pharmacokinetically more impactful).\n\n▶ Selected: Interpretation A\n<|tool_call>verify_claim<|\"|>Omeprazole raises gastric pH and reduces Erlotinib bioavailability by approximately 46% due to impaired dissolution<|\"|>",
