erties are pharmacologically established).\n\n▶ Selected: Interpretation A\n<|tool_call>verify_claim<|\"|>Fluoxetine inhibits CYP2D6 and increases Dextromethorphan levels, causing Serotonin Syndrome risk through combined serotonergic mechanisms<|\"|>",
