ine PK accumulation creates unacceptable risk of symptomatic bradycardia, not therapeutic synergy).\n\n▶ Selected: Interpretation A\n<|tool_call>verify_claim<|\"|>Diltiazem inhibits CYP3A4 and causes additive bradycardia with Ivabradine making the combination contraindicated per FDA labeling<|\"|>",
