y interaction studies confirm a meaningful AUC increase with Fluconazole).\n\n▶ Selected: Interpretation A\n<|tool_call>verify_claim<|\"|>Fluconazole inhibits CYP3A4 and increases Rivaroxaban AUC by approximately 42%, elevating major bleeding risk in elderly anticoagulated patients<|\"|>",
