s vascular effects are less pronounced, the FDA label and clinical evidence confirm a pharmacodynamic interaction exists with all alpha-blockers including Tamsulosin — the risk is reduced, not eliminated).\n\n▶ Selected: Interpretation A\n<|tool_call>verify_claim<|\"|>Tamsulosin and Sildenafil cause additive vasodilation and symptomatic hypotension risk through alpha-1 blockade and PDE5 inhibition mechanisms<|\"|>",
