 concentration at the site of action. (Antibiotics exert their effects at tissue and systemic levels, not urinary concentration for endocarditis; Furosemide does not reduce Gentamicin bactericidal efficacy in the bloodstream).\n\n▶ Selected: Interpretation A\n<|tool_call>verify_claim<|\"|>Furosemide and Gentamicin cause synergistic ototoxicity and additive nephrotoxicity with risk of permanent hearing loss and acute kidney injury<|\"|>",
